<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tiger"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Answer"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901802519"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283047"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>MIREI</songwriter><songwriter>Antti Hynninen</songwriter><songwriter>Adrian Fu &amp; Eva Louhivuori</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">你知道吗 男孩</text><text for="L2">给我听好了！</text><text for="L3">蜷缩在沙发里</text><text for="L4">睫毛膏哭花残留在脸庞</text><text for="L5">碎落满地的</text><text for="L6">薯片残渣 像极了破碎的我们</text><text for="L7">生日时你送的名牌包</text><text for="L8">曾形影不离佩戴的</text><text for="L9">情侣对戒</text><text for="L10">还有在房间里发现的</text><text for="L11">不知是谁留下的耳环</text><text for="L12">如今都不过是过往旧闻了</text><text for="L13">紧紧抱着枕头</text><text for="L14">非得哭到精疲力竭</text><text for="L15">才能勉强入眠的那个我</text><text for="L16">早已不复存在</text><text for="L17">谢谢你</text><text for="L18">多谢了 亲爱的</text><text for="L19">我终于清醒过来</text><text for="L20">我可是猛虎 傲然无畏 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(呼！)</span></text><text for="L21">去抱憾终生吧</text><text for="L22">虽然早已为时过晚</text><text for="L23">因为我如猛虎 锋芒毕露</text><text for="L24">那就听仔细了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L25">我真得好好感谢你 亲爱的 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L26">给我听好</text><text for="L27">才刚收下的</text><text for="L28">那瓶崭新香水</text><text for="L29">挂在二手软件上</text><text for="L30">似乎还能卖个好价钱</text><text for="L31">放跑了气的可乐</text><text for="L32">尝起来都远比你更有滋味</text><text for="L33">求你“眼里只能看着我一人”这种话</text><text for="L34">难道非要我说出口？</text><text for="L35">未免太荒谬了吧</text><text for="L36">只要放眼环顾周遭</text><text for="L37">处处都是比你</text><text for="L38">优秀耀眼得多的人</text><text for="L39">新恋情的预感已然萌芽</text><text for="L40">多谢成全</text><text for="L41">谢谢你啊 宝贝</text><text for="L42">我彻底大梦初醒</text><text for="L43">我就是猛虎 傲然咆哮 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(呼！)</span></text><text for="L44">慢慢悔恨去吧</text><text for="L45">虽然悔之晚矣</text><text for="L46">因为我如猛虎 势不可挡</text><text for="L47">听清楚了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L48">我当真要好好谢谢你 宝贝 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L49">给我听好 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L50">我真心实意感谢你 亲爱的 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L51">别以为事到如今</text><text for="L52">还能重修旧好回到从前</text><text for="L53">直到最后一刻</text><text for="L54">还在肆意摆布折腾</text><text for="L55">自私自利到了极点</text><text for="L56">快放我一个人清静吧</text><text for="L57">给我适可而止一点！</text><text for="L58">真该道声谢</text><text for="L59">多亏了你 宝贝</text><text for="L60">终于让我破茧苏醒</text><text for="L61">我可是猛虎 绝不屈从</text><text for="L62">抱憾终身去吧</text><text for="L63">一切都太迟了</text><text for="L64">因为我如猛虎 傲然独立</text><text for="L65">给我听好了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L66">我真得好好感谢你 宝贝 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L67">洗耳恭听吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L68">我真得好好谢你成全 亲爱的 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L69">听仔细了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L70">我发自肺腑感谢你 宝贝 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L71">听好了 给我听清楚了 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L72">多谢你让我重获新生 亲爱的 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(啦 啦 啦 啦 啦)</span></text><text for="L73">给我听好！</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:51.371"><div begin="0:04.909" end="3:51.371"><p begin="0:04.909" end="0:05.689" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.909" end="0:04.999">You</span> <span begin="0:04.999" end="0:05.089">know</span> <span begin="0:05.089" end="0:05.319">what,</span> <span begin="0:05.319" end="0:05.689">boy?</span></p><p begin="0:07.489" end="0:07.899" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.489" end="0:07.689">Lis</span><span begin="0:07.689" end="0:07.809">ten</span> <span begin="0:07.809" end="0:07.899">up!</span></p><p begin="0:10.065" end="0:11.895" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.065" end="0:10.535">ソ</span><span begin="0:10.535" end="0:10.945">ファ</span><span begin="0:10.945" end="0:11.285">の</span><span begin="0:11.285" end="0:11.895">上</span></p><p begin="0:13.463" end="0:16.947" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.463" end="0:13.643">マ</span><span begin="0:13.643" end="0:13.933">ス</span><span begin="0:13.933" end="0:14.183">カ</span><span begin="0:14.183" end="0:14.533">ラ</span><span begin="0:14.553" end="0:14.863">の</span><span begin="0:14.863" end="0:15.343">つい</span><span begin="0:15.343" end="0:15.753">た</span><span begin="0:15.923" end="0:16.947">顔</span></p><p begin="0:18.154" end="0:19.834" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.154" end="0:18.544">散</span><span begin="0:18.544" end="0:18.914">ら</span><span begin="0:18.914" end="0:19.424">ばっ</span><span begin="0:19.424" end="0:19.834">た</span></p><p begin="0:21.470" end="0:25.010" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.470" end="0:21.680">ポ</span><span begin="0:21.680" end="0:21.950">テ</span><span begin="0:21.950" end="0:22.230">チ</span><span begin="0:22.230" end="0:22.530">は</span><span begin="0:22.580" end="0:22.920">ま</span><span begin="0:22.920" end="0:23.260">る</span><span begin="0:23.470" end="0:23.720">で</span><span begin="0:23.720" end="0:24.480">私</span><span begin="0:24.480" end="0:25.010">達</span></p><p begin="0:26.204" end="0:29.234" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.204" end="0:26.574">誕</span><span begin="0:26.574" end="0:26.924">生</span><span begin="0:26.924" end="0:27.254">日</span><span begin="0:27.494" end="0:27.704">に</span><span begin="0:27.704" end="0:27.854">く</span><span begin="0:27.854" end="0:27.964">れ</span><span begin="0:27.964" end="0:28.184">た</span><span begin="0:28.184" end="0:28.954">バッ</span><span begin="0:28.954" end="0:29.234">グ</span></p><p begin="0:29.520" end="0:31.250" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.520" end="0:29.690">い</span><span begin="0:29.690" end="0:29.830">つ</span><span begin="0:29.830" end="0:29.950">も</span><span begin="0:29.950" end="0:30.180">つ</span><span begin="0:30.180" end="0:30.540">け</span><span begin="0:30.540" end="0:30.900">て</span><span begin="0:30.900" end="0:31.250">た</span></p><p begin="0:31.475" end="0:33.045" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.475" end="0:31.825">ペ</span><span begin="0:31.825" end="0:32.015">ア</span><span begin="0:32.015" end="0:32.505">リン</span><span begin="0:32.505" end="0:33.045">グ</span></p><p begin="0:33.447" end="0:35.247" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.447" end="0:33.777">部</span><span begin="0:33.777" end="0:33.997">屋</span><span begin="0:33.997" end="0:34.177">に</span><span begin="0:34.277" end="0:34.927">あっ</span><span begin="0:34.927" end="0:35.247">た</span></p><p begin="0:35.480" end="0:37.220" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.480" end="0:35.840">誰</span><span begin="0:35.840" end="0:36.000">か</span><span begin="0:36.000" end="0:36.170">の</span><span begin="0:36.170" end="0:36.550">ピ</span><span begin="0:36.660" end="0:36.880">ア</span><span begin="0:36.880" end="0:37.220">ス</span></p><p begin="0:37.493" end="0:41.253" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.493" end="0:37.723">もう</span><span begin="0:37.723" end="0:37.853">た</span><span begin="0:37.853" end="0:37.983">だ</span><span begin="0:37.983" end="0:38.163">の</span><span begin="0:38.163" end="0:39.213">昔</span><span begin="0:39.463" end="0:40.353">話</span><span begin="0:40.353" end="0:41.253">ね</span></p><p begin="0:42.137" end="0:45.707" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.137" end="0:43.637">枕</span><span begin="0:43.637" end="0:43.927">抱</span><span begin="0:43.927" end="0:44.357">き</span><span begin="0:44.357" end="0:44.777">し</span><span begin="0:44.777" end="0:44.927">め</span><span begin="0:44.927" end="0:45.707">て</span></p><p begin="0:45.983" end="0:48.333" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.983" end="0:46.153">泣</span><span begin="0:46.153" end="0:46.573">き</span><span begin="0:46.573" end="0:47.113">つ</span><span begin="0:47.113" end="0:47.513">か</span><span begin="0:47.513" end="0:47.663">れ</span><span begin="0:47.663" end="0:47.963">な</span><span begin="0:47.963" end="0:48.333">きゃ</span></p><p begin="0:50.186" end="0:53.716" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.186" end="0:50.606">寝</span><span begin="0:50.606" end="0:51.106">付</span><span begin="0:51.106" end="0:51.646">け</span><span begin="0:51.646" end="0:51.906">な</span><span begin="0:51.906" end="0:52.956">かっ</span><span begin="0:52.956" end="0:53.716">た</span></p><p begin="0:53.976" end="0:56.826" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.976" end="0:54.726">私</span><span begin="0:54.726" end="0:55.136">は</span><span begin="0:55.136" end="0:55.736">もう</span><span begin="0:55.736" end="0:55.996">い</span><span begin="0:55.996" end="0:56.826">ない</span></p><p begin="0:57.002" end="0:58.172" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.002" end="0:57.152">あ</span><span begin="0:57.152" end="0:57.462">り</span><span begin="0:57.462" end="0:57.642">が</span><span begin="0:57.642" end="0:58.172">とう</span></p><p begin="0:58.173" end="0:59.713" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.173" end="0:58.673">Thank</span> <span begin="0:58.673" end="0:58.933">you</span> <span begin="0:58.933" end="0:59.713">babe</span></p><p begin="1:00.225" end="1:01.595" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.225" end="1:00.565">目が</span><span begin="1:00.565" end="1:00.965">覚め</span><span begin="1:00.965" end="1:01.595">た</span></p><p begin="1:02.043" end="1:05.703" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.043" end="1:02.163">I'm</span> <span begin="1:02.163" end="1:02.213">a</span> <span begin="1:02.213" end="1:03.223">ti</span><span begin="1:03.223" end="1:03.733">ger,</span> <span begin="1:04.183" end="1:05.193">ti</span><span begin="1:05.193" end="1:05.703">ger</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:05.704" end="1:06.154">(Woo!)</span></span></p><p begin="1:06.155" end="1:07.615" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.155" end="1:06.565">後</span><span begin="1:06.565" end="1:06.885">悔</span><span begin="1:06.885" end="1:07.015">し</span><span b